# T14 Model perform (BUILD_PLAN wave 3): fixtures that pass at their manifest tier through rig_render + compare.mjs.
# Taken over from golden.integ (wave-2 integrator): auto-filter-cutoff (promoted to exact by T14), song-lofi-rhodes,
# transpose-octave-range, release-pedalhold.
# release-pedalhold: its pedal-up event is posted up front with the others, so in BOTH engines the pedalHold timer at
# 5.4 s finds the note already un-pedaled: the fixture proves release + sustain, not the pedalHold fade (unit.perform).
# (Review: the drop to digital silence at 5.4-5.8 s is the end of the E4 sample, 3.16 s with a baked 0.4 s tail
# fade, started at 2.6 s; it coincides with the 5.4 s timer but is not the fade.)
auto-filter-cutoff
song-lofi-rhodes
transpose-octave-range
release-pedalhold
bend-pitch-sampler
bend-tape
mono-legato
panic-fadeout
